1465
01:11:13,520 --> 01:11:16,520
But otherwise, I'm just generally curiosity driven.

1466
01:11:16,520 --> 01:11:19,520
And whatever I say I'll do, I probably change my mind because something more interesting

1467
01:11:19,520 --> 01:11:20,520
will come along.

1468
01:11:20,520 --> 01:11:21,520
But I think that's fine.

