1487
01:12:14,520 --> 01:12:15,520
He did a lot on his own as well.

1488
01:12:15,520 --> 01:12:17,520
And he was just fascinated with it.

1489
01:12:17,520 --> 01:12:21,520
And I think it was good to kind of build his confidence while he was kind of stuck in Finland

1490
