1493
01:12:33,520 --> 01:12:35,520
But he's trying to decide between that and political science.

1494
01:12:35,520 --> 01:12:39,520
And now he's getting a degree because he could take courses in Finland.

1495
01:12:39,520 --> 01:12:44,520
But even if he petitioned and took every course as a resident, he's allowed to, they still

1496
01:12:44,520 --> 01:12:45,520
won't give him the degree.

1497
01:12:45,520 --> 01:12:46,520
Or if he publishes all the papers for a PhD.

1498
01:12:46,520 --> 01:12:48,520
They won't give him the degree.

1499
01:12:48,520 --> 01:12:52,520
Because in the Finnish system, you know, things are very, apparently it's like that all over

1500
01:12:52,520 --> 01:12:53,520
Europe.

1501
01:12:53,520 --> 01:12:56,520
You have to kind of go, there's no exceptions to the kind of standard rules and stuff.

1502
01:12:56,520 --> 01:12:59,520
So he'll have to figure out what he wants to do after he finishes his degree.

1503
01:12:59,520 --> 01:13:01,520
But it was a wonderful time to work with him.

1504
01:13:01,520 --> 01:13:02,520
It was exciting.

