01:13:06,520 --> 01:13:07,520
We just had so much fun.

1508
01:13:07,520 --> 01:13:10,520
You know, he was, you know, my son Alex was doing a lot of the coding.

1509
01:13:10,520 --> 01:13:11,520
I was doing a lot of the mathematical stuff.

1510
01:13:11,520 --> 01:13:14,520
And Bashak was also doing even more of the mathematical stuff.

1511
01:13:14,520 --> 01:13:15,520
And we had a really great time.

1512
01:13:15,520 --> 01:13:16,520
And, you know, I think that's a really good thing.

